          "Q4. What comes next in the alternating series: 11, 13, 20, 17, 29, 21, 38, ?\n(a) 25\n(b) 26\n(c) 47\n(d) 50\nCorrect Answer: (a) 25 [Explanation: Split into two interwoven series: Series 1 (odd positions): 11, 20, 29, 38 (adding +9 each step). Series 2 (even positions): 13, 17, 21, ? (adding +4 each step). The missing term is 21 + 4 = 25.]",
