    "topic_title": "Bhakti & Sufi Movements: Philosophies, Saints & Cultural Synthesis",
    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Who established the egalitarian community kitchen institution of 'Langar' to dismantle caste hierarchies through shared communal dining?\n(a) Ramananda\n(b) Guru Nanak\n(c) Chaitanya Mahaprabhu\n(d) Vallabhacharya\nCorrect Answer: (b) Guru Nanak [Explanation: Guru Nanak institutionalized 'Langar' (free community kitchen) where all individuals, regardless of caste, creed, or gender, sat together as equals in Pangat to dine.]"
