    "raw_text": "Q3. British commander Sir Hugh Rose, after capturing Gwalior, paid tribute to which rebel leader as 'the only man among the rebels' and 'the bravest and best military leader'?\n(a) Begum Hazrat Mahal\n(b) Rani Lakshmibai\n(c) Tatya Tope\n(d) Nana Saheb\nCorrect Answer: (b) Rani Lakshmibai [Explanation: General Sir Hugh Rose, who commanded the Central India Field Force, lauded Rani Lakshmibai of Jhansi for her unparalleled valor after she fell in battle at Kotah-ki-Serai.]"
