    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Which legendary revolutionary, revered as 'Masterda', led the audacious Chittagong Armoury Raid on 18 April 1930 and proclaimed a Provisional Revolutionary Government?\n(a) Rash Behari Bose\n(b) Surya Sen\n(c) Jatindranath Mukherjee (Bagha Jatin)\n(d) Sachindra Nath Sanyal\nCorrect Answer: (b) Surya Sen [Explanation: Surya Sen ('Masterda'), a schoolteacher, organized the Indian Republican Army and executed the famous raid on the British police and auxiliary armouries at Chittagong.]"
