    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q5. In January 1923, Chittaranjan Das and Motilal Nehru founded which political party to contest elections and wreck the 1919 Montagu-Chelmsford legislative councils from within?\n(a) Independent Labour Party\n(b) Swaraj Party (Congress-Khilafat Swarajya Party)\n(c) Forward Bloc\n(d) Justice Party\nCorrect Answer: (b) Swaraj Party (Congress-Khilafat Swarajya Party) [Explanation: C.R. Das and Motilal Nehru founded the Congress-Khilafat Swarajya Party (Swaraj Party) in January 1923 to enter legislative councils and obstruct colonial governance from within.]"
