    "topic_title": "Civil Disobedience: Dandi March, Round Table Conferences & Poona Pact",
    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q1. At which historic annual session of the Indian National Congress in December 1929 was the resolution for 'Purna Swaraj' (Complete Independence) officially adopted under the presidency of Jawaharlal Nehru?\n(a) Madras Session\n(b) Lahore Session\n(c) Karachi Session\n(d) Calcutta Session\nCorrect Answer: (b) Lahore Session [Explanation: The historic Lahore Congress of December 1929, presided over by Jawaharlal Nehru, proclaimed Purna Swaraj (Complete Independence) as the ultimate national goal.]"
