    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q2. The historic Dandi Salt March commenced from Sabarmati Ashram on 12 March 1930 with how many chosen ashramite volunteers accompanying Mahatma Gandhi?\n(a) 50 volunteers\n(b) 72 volunteers\n(c) 78 volunteers\n(d) 100 volunteers\nCorrect Answer: (c) 78 volunteers [Explanation: Gandhi marched 240 miles from Sabarmati Ashram to the Dandi coastline accompanied initially by 78 handpicked ashramite satyagrahis, reaching Dandi on 5 April 1930.]"
