    "raw_text": "Q3. In Tamil Nadu, who led the parallel coastal Salt Satyagraha march from Tiruchirappalli to Vedaranyam in April 1930?\n(a) K. Kamaraj\n(b) C. Rajagopalachari\n(c) Subramania Bharati\n(d) V.O. Chidambaram Pillai\nCorrect Answer: (b) C. Rajagopalachari [Explanation: C. Rajagopalachari (Rajaji) led a group of 100 Congress volunteers from Trichy to Vedaranyam on the Tanjore coast to break the salt law in April 1930.]"
