    "raw_text": "Q4. Which Indian leader attended all three Round Table Conferences held in London between 1930 and 1932 to advocate for the rights of the Depressed Classes?\n(a) Mahatma Gandhi\n(b) Dr. B.R. Ambedkar\n(c) Jawaharlal Nehru\n(d) Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel\nCorrect Answer: (b) Dr. B.R. Ambedkar [Explanation: Dr. B.R. Ambedkar and Sir Tej Bahadur Sapru attended all three Round Table Conferences in London (1930, 1931, and 1932).]"
