    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q1. At the Gowalia Tank Maidan in Bombay on 8 August 1942, Mahatma Gandhi delivered which historic clarion call to the nation while launching the Quit India Movement?\n(a) 'Swaraj is my birthright'\n(b) 'Do or Die' (Karo ya Maro)\n(c) 'Inquilab Zindabad'\n(d) 'Give me blood, and I shall give you freedom'\nCorrect Answer: (b) 'Do or Die' (Karo ya Maro) [Explanation: Gandhi gave the memorable mantra 'Do or Die' at Gowalia Tank on 8 August 1942, declaring: 'We shall either free India or die in the attempt.']"
