    "topic_title": "Mineral & Energy Resources of India & AP: Barytes, Bauxite, Uranium & KG Basin",
    "subject_title": "Geography of India & Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q5. The 1,000 MW Kurnool Ultra Mega Solar Park, one of the earliest mega single-location solar power installations in India, is situated in which mandal?\n(a) Orvakal\n(b) Bethamcherla\n(c) Banaganapalle\n(d) Dhone\nCorrect Answer: (a) Orvakal [Explanation: The 1,000 MW Kurnool Solar Park is situated across Orvakal mandal in Kurnool district, commissioned over 5,900 acres.]"
