    "topic_title": "Industrial Regions & Corridors of AP: VCIC, CBIC & Major Ports",
    "subject_title": "Geography of India & Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q3. India's first shore-based integrated steel manufacturing plant, Rashtriya Ispat Nigam Limited (RINL), is situated at:\n(a) Machilipatnam\n(b) Visakhapatnam\n(c) Kakinada\n(d) Krishnapatnam\nCorrect Answer: (b) Visakhapatnam [Explanation: Visakhapatnam Steel Plant (Vizag Steel / RINL) was commissioned in 1990 as India's first coastal shore-based integrated steel plant.]"
