    "topic_title": "Industrial Regions & Corridors of AP: VCIC, CBIC & Major Ports",
    "subject_title": "Geography of India & Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Which private deepwater port in Andhra Pradesh, developed on the coast of SPSR Nellore district, is among the fastest-growing modern container and bulk cargo ports?\n(a) Kakinada Port\n(b) Krishnapatnam Port\n(c) Bhavanapadu Port\n(d) Nizampatnam Port\nCorrect Answer: (b) Krishnapatnam Port [Explanation: Krishnapatnam Port (operated by Adani Ports) in Nellore is a major deepwater, all-weather automated commercial port on the east coast.]"
