    "topic_title": "Demographic Profile & Tribal Communities of Andhra Pradesh",
    "subject_title": "Geography of India & Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q1. According to the 2011 Census, what is the overall sex ratio (females per 1,000 males) for the state of Andhra Pradesh?\n(a) 943\n(b) 974\n(c) 997\n(d) 1004\nCorrect Answer: (c) 997 [Explanation: Andhra Pradesh recorded a healthy sex ratio of 997 females per 1,000 males in Census 2011, notably above the national average of 943.]"
