    "topic_title": "Demographic Profile & Tribal Communities of Andhra Pradesh",
    "subject_title": "Geography of India & Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Which landmark state regulation strictly prohibits the transfer of any land in Scheduled Agency tracts of Andhra Pradesh to non-tribal individuals?\n(a) Land Ceiling Act 1973\n(b) AP Agency Land Transfer Regulation 1 of 1970 (LTR 1/70)\n(c) PESA Act 1996\n(d) Forest Conservation Act\nCorrect Answer: (b) AP Agency Land Transfer Regulation 1 of 1970 (LTR 1/70) [Explanation: Regulation 1 of 1970 (amending 1959 regulations) created an absolute statutory presumption that all land in Agency tracts belongs to tribals, barring transfer to non-tribals.]"
