    "topic_title": "Statutory & Regulatory Bodies: NITI Aayog, NHRC, Lokpal & CVC",
    "subject_title": "Polity, Constitution & Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q2. The Selection Committee that recommends the appointment of the Chairperson and Members of the National Human Rights Commission (NHRC) is headed by:\n(a) Chief Justice of India\n(b) President of India\n(c) Prime Minister of India\n(d) Union Home Minister\nCorrect Answer: (c) Prime Minister of India [Explanation: Under the Protection of Human Rights Act 1993, the selection committee is chaired by the Prime Minister and includes the Speaker, Home Minister, and Leaders of the Opposition.]"
