    "topic_title": "Statutory & Regulatory Bodies: NITI Aayog, NHRC, Lokpal & CVC",
    "subject_title": "Polity, Constitution & Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q3. Which landmark committee on the Prevention of Corruption appointed in 1962 recommended the establishment of the Central Vigilance Commission (CVC)?\n(a) K. Santhanam Committee\n(b) Sarkaria Commission\n(c) Gorwala Committee\n(d) Paul Appleby Committee\nCorrect Answer: (a) K. Santhanam Committee [Explanation: The Santhanam Committee on Prevention of Corruption (1962–1964) recommended creating the CVC to tackle corruption in central government administration.]"
