    "topic_title": "Statutory & Regulatory Bodies: NITI Aayog, NHRC, Lokpal & CVC",
    "subject_title": "Polity, Constitution & Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Under the Lokpal and Lokayuktas Act 2013, what minimum proportion of the members of the Lokpal must be drawn from SCs, STs, OBCs, Minorities, and Women?\n(a) 25%\n(b) 33.33%\n(c) 50%\n(d) 60%\nCorrect Answer: (c) 50% [Explanation: Section 3(3) of the Lokpal Act mandates that not less than 50% of the members of the Lokpal shall be from SCs, STs, OBCs, Minorities, and Women.]"
