    "subject_title": "Polity, Constitution & Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q5. The Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI), which oversees and regulates the insurance sector in India, is headquartered in which city?\n(a) Mumbai\n(b) New Delhi\n(c) Hyderabad\n(d) Bengaluru\nCorrect Answer: (c) Hyderabad [Explanation: IRDAI is a statutory regulatory body established in 1999 and headquartered in Hyderabad, Telangana (formerly undivided Andhra Pradesh).]"
