    "subject_title": "Ethics and Law",
    "raw_text": "Q1. Who authored the bestselling book 'Emotional Intelligence: Why It Can Matter More Than IQ' (1995), popularizing the modern five-domain framework of EI?\n(a) Howard Gardner\n(b) Daniel Goleman\n(c) Peter Salovey\n(d) John Mayer\nCorrect Answer: (b) Daniel Goleman [Explanation: Psychologist Daniel Goleman popularized Emotional Intelligence in 1995, outlining the five core competencies of self-awareness, self-regulation, motivation, empathy, and social skill.]"
