    "topic_title": "New Criminal Law Framework: BNS, BNSS & BSA 2023",
    "subject_title": "Ethics and Law",
    "raw_text": "**Q: Under the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS) 2023, 'Community Service' has been introduced as a punishment for which of the following categories of offences?**\n* (a) Homicide by negligence\n* (b) Minor / Petty offences (e.g., small theft below Rs 5,000, defamation)\n* (c) Organized cyber fraud\n* (d) Grievous hurt\n* **Answer: (b)**\n* *Explanation:* BNS 2023 introduces community service as an alternative penal measure for six petty offences, including defamation, misconduct by a drunken person, and theft of property valued under Rs 5,000 if the stolen property is restored."
