    "raw_text": "**Q: Under the Industrial Relations Code, 2020, what is the raised establishment workforce threshold above which prior government permission is mandatory for retrenchment, layoff, or closure?**\n* (a) 100 workers\n* (b) 200 workers\n* (c) 300 workers\n* (d) 500 workers\n* **Answer: (c)**\n* *Explanation:* The Industrial Relations Code 2020 raised the workforce threshold for requiring prior government permission for retrenchment, layoffs, and factory closures from 100 workers (under the 1947 Act) to 300 workers."
