    "raw_text": "**Q: Which facility was introduced by RBI in 2022 as the new non-collateralized floor of the Liquidity Adjustment Facility (LAF) corridor?**\n* (a) Reverse Repo Rate\n* (b) Standing Deposit Facility (SDF)\n* (c) Marginal Standing Facility (MSF)\n* (d) Bank Rate\n* **Answer: (b)**\n* *Explanation:* In April 2022, RBI operationalized the Standing Deposit Facility (SDF) at 25 bps below the policy repo rate as the uncollateralized floor of the LAF corridor, replacing the fixed reverse repo rate."
