    "raw_text": "**Q: What was the code name of the historic DRDO flight test in March 2024 that successfully demonstrated the Agni-V missile with Multiple Independently Targetable Re-entry Vehicle (MIRV) technology?**\n* (a) Mission Shakti\n* (b) Mission Divyastra\n* (c) Mission Sudarshan\n* (d) Mission Astra\n* **Answer: (b)**\n* *Explanation:* In March 2024, DRDO successfully conducted 'Mission Divyastra', the maiden flight test of the indigenously developed Agni-V missile equipped with Multiple Independently Targetable Re-entry Vehicle (MIRV) technology."
