    "raw_text": "**Q: What fuel combination and coolant are utilized in the 500 MWe Prototype Fast Breeder Reactor (PFBR) at Kalpakkam?**\n* (a) Enriched Uranium with Light Water\n* (b) Natural Uranium with Heavy Water\n* (c) Plutonium-Uranium mixed oxide (MOX) with Liquid Sodium coolant\n* (d) Thorium-232 with Molten Lead\n* **Answer: (c)**\n* *Explanation:* The PFBR at Kalpakkam utilizes Mixed Oxide (MOX) fuel comprising Plutonium-239 and Uranium-238, cooled by liquid sodium which enables fast neutron breeding without moderation."
