    "subject_title": "Science, Technology & Environment",
    "raw_text": "**Q: In Stage 1 of India's nuclear power programme (PHWRs), what substance is utilized as both moderator and coolant?**\n* (a) Light Water ($H_2O$)\n* (b) Heavy Water ($D_2O$ - Deuterium Oxide)\n* (c) Liquid Sodium\n* (d) Graphite\n* **Answer: (b)**\n* *Explanation:* Pressurized Heavy Water Reactors (PHWRs) use Heavy Water ($D_2O$) as both coolant and moderator, which allows them to run on natural unenriched uranium."
