    "topic_title": "Logical Reasoning, Analytical Ability, Syllogisms & Seating Arrangements",
    "subject_title": "General Mental and Psychological Abilities",
    "raw_text": "Q4. In a code language, if 'NOIDA' is coded as '39658', how is 'INDIA' coded?\n(a) 63568\n(b) 63586\n(c) 65628\n(d) 36568\nCorrect Answer: (a) 63568 [Explanation: Comparing corresponding letters in NOIDA (N=3, O=9, I=6, D=5, A=8). For INDIA: I=6, N=3, D=5, I=6, A=8, giving 63568.]"
